{"parentUuid":"8431502d-0078-43f7-9a7b-bd0625c7a4fd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f05d84df-2f6c-48b0-9d64-cc17cb4f781a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nLinked sessions now (status, not an instruction): allauth-upgrade = local_2c0bf928-2175-4569-9108-2cb6cba1fb77 (idle); first-run-flow = local_cea7b182-1404-4ee3-afa3-e87cbafe7c2d (idle); use-a-jusprin-syndicate = local_69a34677-cdae-4851-90bb-557cd0ba6d32 (idle, started by first-run-flow). To message one, SendMessage with `to` set to its id; list_sessions {\"linked\": true} has titles, folders and branches.\n</system-reminder>\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Let's assume we don't have any active links or buttons inside this page. For this one, we can say sign up today without a link, right? We can even program the server to check for the account status and if the user has already signed up and subscribed or paid, the server can just return none, right?"}]},"uuid":"a59553b1-54ae-402e-a763-6539e611be3c","timestamp":"2026-11-06T18:05:38.322Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":30,"turnIndex":41},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
