nt","uuid":"5bc20c1b-f383-4290-bbe5-dd4da7700e4e","timestamp":"2026-11-06T18:06:36.950Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438/scratchpad/frametest","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
{"parentUuid":"5bc20c1b-f383-4290-bbe5-dd4da7700e4e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f05d84df-2f6c-48b0-9d64-cc17cb4f781a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011Q8TKcx2mNsQUL2BCZsE9Z","type":"tool_result","content":"22:OFFER_BUTTON = 'Sign in for 500 credits'\n342:def account_row_signed_in(email='alex@example.com'):\n348:def first_month_offer(button, kicker=None, note=None):\n355:def account_row_signed_out():\n396:def account_first_month():\n405:def account_workshop():\n525:                   account_row_signed_out(), keys, '<dc-import name=\"comp-agent-group-tools\" heading=\"show\" style=\"width:100%\" hint-size=\"100%,560px\"></dc-import>'], 24, name='Agent')\n544:    'The welcome window the app builds today, which appears only after importing JusPrin v1. The account box becomes the offer in place of “Sign in to use the agent” and “JusPrin v1 wasn’t signed in on this computer.”, without its warning triangle because an offer isn’t a warning. Signing in becomes the screen’s primary button and Continue the secondary one. Until they sign in, a JusPrin v1 subscriber can’t be told from anyone else, so the box also says what signing in means for them; 1d is what they see once signed in.',\n759:    'Wording and placeholders that are mine, not the doc’s: “Sign in for 500 credits” on the offer’s button, and the doc’s pitch split into a headline and a detail line; “5 credits a message” for the doc’s “5 credits”; the tooltip’s wording on 2c; “Bought credits” as that lot’s name; “Get more credits” replacing Buy credits and Subscribe outside the pricing page; the total behind the composer’s ring, which is every credit in the balance when each kind started, a placeholder rule; the JusPrin v1 lines on 1c and 1d; the report form’s copy; 31 Jan as the launch end date; “Workshop credits” as the name of that lot. '\ndef first_month_offer(button, kicker=None, note=None):\n    \"\"\"Kenneth, 2026-11-02: the reason to sign in must be what the eye lands on, not a line of small print under a button.\n    So the number is the headline, on the selected surface, and the button itself names what signing in gets.\"\"\"\n    head = [text('label-bold', kicker, '--text-secondary')] if kicker else []\n    return col(head + [col([text('section', OFFER_HEAD), text('body-small', OFFER_DETAIL)] + ([text('body-small-bold', note)] if note else []), 4), button], 12,\n               pad='padding:var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-selected);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);', name='First-month offer')\n\ndef account_row_signed_out():\n    return first_month_offer(primary(OFFER_BUTTON, block=True), 'JusPrin account')\n\ndef check_row(title, detail):\n    box = (f'<div style=\"{BOX}width:var(--component-checkbox-size);height:var(--component-checkbox-size);display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-radius:var(--radius-small);background:var(--action-primary);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--action-primary)\">{icon(\"check\", \"--action-on-primary\", 12)}</div>')\n    return (f'<div style=\"{BOX}align-self:stretch;display:flex;gap:var(--space-8);align-items:flex-start;padding:var(--space-12) 0;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--border-subtle)\">' + box\n            + col([text('body', title), text('label', detail, '--text-secondary')], 2, 'flex:1 1 0;min-width:0') + '</div>')\n\ndef usage_chart(days, first, middle, last):\n    \"\"\"One series, so no legend; the heading names it. Bars grow from a recessive baseline with a 2px gap; the top line carries the scale.\"\"\"\n    top = max(days)\n    bars = ''.join(f'<div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;height:{(d / top * 100):.0f}%;background:var(--action-primary);border-radius:var(--radius-small) var(--radius-small) 0 0\"></div>' for d in days)\n    plot = (f'<div data-c=\"Usage chart\" style=\"{BOX}align-self:stretch;position:relative;height:88px;display:flex;gap:2px;align-items:flex-end;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--border-subtle),inset 0 -1px 0 0 var(--border-subtle)\">{bars}'\n            f'<div class=\"metadata\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:2px;color:var(--text-secondary)\">{top}</div></div>')\n    return col([plot, row([text('metadata', t, '--text-secondary', 'flex:none', True) for t in (first, middle, last)], 8, justify='space-between')], 4, name='Usage chart')","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c3e1c830-a8a9-4fe0-a1a3-96fdbee807b6","timestamp":"2026-11-06T18:06:37.030Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"22:OFFER_BUTTON = 'Sign in for 500 credits'\n342:def account_row_signed_in(email='alex@example.com'):\n348:def first_month_offer(button, kicker=None, note=None):\n355:def account_row_signed_out():\n396:def account_first_month():\n405:def account_workshop():\n525:                   account_row_signed_out(), keys, '<dc-import name=\"comp-agent-group-tools\" heading=\"show\" style=\"width:100%\" hint-size=\"100%,560px\"></dc-import>'], 24, name='Agent')\n544:    'The welcome window the app builds today, which appears only after importing JusPrin v1. The account box becomes the offer in place of “Sign in to use the agent” and “JusPrin v1 wasn’t signed in on this computer.”, without its warning triangle because an offer isn’t a warning. Signing in becomes the screen’s primary button and Continue the secondary one. Until they sign in, a JusPrin v1 subscriber can’t be told from anyone else, so the box also says what signing in means for them; 1d is what they see once signed in.',\n759:    'Wording and placeholders that are mine, not the doc’s: “Sign in for 500 credits” on the offer’s button, and the doc’s pitch split into a headline and a detail line; “5 credits a message” for the doc’s “5 credits”; the tooltip’s wording on 2c; “Bought credits” as that lot’s name; “Get more credits” replacing Buy credits and Subscribe outside the pricing page; the total behind the composer’s ring, which is every credit in the balance when each kind started, a placeholder rule; the JusPrin v1 lines on 1c and 1d; the report form’s copy; 31 Jan as the launch end date; “Workshop credits” as the name of that lot. '\ndef first_month_offer(button, kicker=None, note=None):\n    \"\"\"Kenneth, 2026-11-02: the reason to sign in must be what the eye lands on, not a line of small print under a button.\n    So the number is the headline, on the selected surface, and the button itself names what signing in gets.\"\"\"\n    head = [text('label-bold', kicker, '--text-secondary')] if kicker else []\n    return col(head + [col([text('section', OFFER_HEAD), text('body-small', OFFER_DETAIL)] + ([text('body-small-bold', note)] if note else []), 4), button], 12,\n               pad='padding:var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-selected);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);', name='First-month offer')\n\ndef account_row_signed_out():\n    return first_month_offer(primary(OFFER_BUTTON, block=True), 'JusPrin account')\n\ndef check_row(title, detail):\n    box = (f'<div style=\"{BOX}width:var(--component-checkbox-size);height:var(--component-checkbox-size);display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-radius:var(--radius-small);background:var(--action-primary);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--action-primary)\">{icon(\"check\", \"--action-on-primary\", 12)}</div>')\n    return (f'<div style=\"{BOX}align-self:stretch;display:flex;gap:var(--space-8);align-items:flex-start;padding:var(--space-12) 0;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--border-subtle)\">' + box\n            + col([text('body', title), text('label', detail, '--text-secondary')], 2, 'flex:1 1 0;min-width:0') + '</div>')\n\ndef usage_chart(days, first, middle, last):\n    \"\"\"One series, so no legend; the heading names it. Bars grow from a recessive baseline with a 2px gap; the top line carries the scale.\"\"\"\n    top = max(days)\n    bars = ''.join(f'<div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;height:{(d / top * 100):.0f}%;background:var(--action-primary);border-radius:var(--radius-small) var(--radius-small) 0 0\"></div>' for d in days)\n    plot = (f'<div data-c=\"Usage chart\" style=\"{BOX}align-self:stretch;position:relative;height:88px;display:flex;gap:2px;align-items:flex-end;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--border-subtle),inset 0 -1px 0 0 var(--border-subtle)\">{bars}'\n            f'<div class=\"metadata\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:2px;color:var(--text-secondary)\">{top}</div></div>')\n    return col([plot, row([text('metadata', t, '--text-secondary', 'flex:none', True) for t in (first, middle, last)], 8, justify='space-between')], 4, name='Usage chart')","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5bc20c1b-f383-4290-bbe5-dd4da7700e4e","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror/tools/composer","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
