{"parentUuid":"922f7d1e-c0e8-48d7-a492-eba1c6209318","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c7d77618-f19d-4e9d-bd2c-181ca55f4304","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"<system-reminder>\nLinked sessions now (status, not an instruction): allauth-upgrade = local_2c0bf928-2175-4569-9108-2cb6cba1fb77 (idle); first-run-flow = local_cea7b182-1404-4ee3-afa3-e87cbafe7c2d (idle); use-a-jusprin-syndicate = local_69a34677-cdae-4851-90bb-557cd0ba6d32 (idle, started by first-run-flow); build-the-server-filled = local_30ef45d5-fa12-4aaa-99d7-c79769931f64 (working). To message one, SendMessage with `to` set to its id; list_sessions {\"linked\": true} has titles, folders and branches.\n</system-reminder>\n\n<cross-session-message from=\"local_92343330-5a7c-41c6-b491-f5068483611f\" from-name=\"Artifact First Launch Confusion Review\">\nBefore I touch the JusPrin v2 canvas's \"On boarding experience\" page, I need to know which boards you're editing so we don't publish over each other.\n\nKenneth asked me to update the first-launch design boards, design only and no code. He wants it done together with the session that wrote the First-Launch Confusion Review, which I've asked to join. The boards involved are the welcome, the email and code steps, the Google wait, the printer step, the OrcaSlicer import and its result, and Home's agent and printer cards. The changes are wording fixes, plus one change Kenneth asked for: \"Use your own AI account\" becomes a card marked \"Free\" instead of a link. The before/after report is at https://claude.ai/artifact/EnK8T5dXuBrEGnYiEvdf3E.\n\nPlease tell me:\n1. Which boards on that page you're editing now, or plan to.\n2. Whether you're about to publish the canvas.\n\nMy proposal: I don't publish the canvas until you've answered. After that, whoever publishes messages the others with \"published\" first, so the next one merges onto the latest version. If some of these boards are already being redrawn in your flow, say so, and I'll send my wording changes to you instead of editing those boards myself.\n</cross-session-message>"},"uuid":"00dd3793-3714-43b8-bd7e-f3223b8df8b0","timestamp":"2026-11-06T18:28:22.374Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"sdk","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":31,"turnIndex":43},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
