{"parentUuid":"f317ee7f-dbdc-42b4-8495-789ce382b99a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgn9ZHfCHEM6XasxgYA4C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012Hiq1MT6T598znmgUMRJDZ","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"local_92343330-5a7c-41c6-b491-f5068483611f","summary":"Reply: not editing onboarding boards, not publishing","message":"I'm not editing any board on \"On boarding experience\", and I'm not about to publish the canvas. Go ahead.\n\n1. My boards are the money-* boards on the \"Credits & plans\" page, from y=2900. I have no edits pending there; I published version 131 (version id 1793988474-55d8) and stopped. One of them touches yours indirectly: \"money-01-welcome-see-prices\" is built by copying the welcome board `first-run-welcome-01-clip-beat-1.dc.html` and swapping its offer lines for \"Sign up and get 500 free credits\" / \"Good for your first month: about 100 Expert questions. After that, 50 free credits a month. See prices\". If you reword the welcome's offer, tell me the new lines. Then I'll make that board match. If I rebuild it before then, my swap may no longer find the old lines.\n\n2. Publishing: agreed. Whoever publishes messages the others with \"published\" and the version number first. Build onto the latest version, not a local copy: canvas.json is one shared file, so publishing a stale one overwrites the other session's board positions and notes. My local copy is `/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror/work-first-run-v2/project/`, and it matches version 131.\n\nAlso: this session wrote the First-Launch Confusion Review (https://claude.ai/artifact/91wmdS3QU8UkzbPi1zog15). Ask me if anything in it is unclear. I'm not redrawing any of those boards myself. The fixes went to the first-run-flow session (local_cea7b182-1404-4ee3-afa3-e87cbafe7c2d) as code work, so check with it before changing a board it may be building from.","type":"message","recipient":"local_92343330-5a7c-41c6-b491-f5068483611f","recipient_kind":"session","content":"I'm not editing any board on \"On boarding experie…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2815,"cache_read_input_tokens":179606,"output_tokens":704,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2815,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":704,"cache_read_input_tokens":179606,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2815,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2815},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_012Hiq1MT6T598znmgUMRJDZ":{"to":"local_92343330-5a7c-41c6-b491-f5068483611f","summary":"Reply: not editing onboarding boards, not publishing","message":"I'm not editing any board on \"On boarding experience\", and I'm not about to publish the canvas. Go ahead.\n\n1. My boards are the money-* boards on the \"Credits & plans\" page, from y=2900. I have no edits pending there; I published version 131 (version id 1793988474-55d8) and stopped. One of them touches yours indirectly: \"money-01-welcome-see-prices\" is built by copying the welcome board `first-run-welcome-01-clip-beat-1.dc.html` and swapping its offer lines for \"Sign up and get 500 free credits\" / \"Good for your first month: about 100 Expert questions. After that, 50 free credits a month. See prices\". If you reword the welcome's offer, tell me the new lines. Then I'll make that board match. If I rebuild it before then, my swap may no longer find the old lines.\n\n2. Publishing: agreed. Whoever publishes messages the others with \"publi