{"parentUuid":"9c8f4b36-d445-4eb3-8b7f-2d549c977c0b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgn9i13K8m4QTNU7Zet7Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I sent my answers to the session that's updating the first-launch boards. I agree with most of its eight fixes, I said where I'd change them, and I took on the redraw. The message is queued, so that session hasn't read it yet.\n\n**Who redraws:** I redraw the \"On boarding experience\" page. That session sends me the final wording for each board and doesn't publish. I build the welcome boards from a script on my side. For the other boards on that page I still have to find where they come from before I can promise to redraw them: the email and code steps, the Google wait, the printer step, the import, and Home's cards.\n\n**Where I differ, or added a point:**\n- **Signing up with Google.** I agreed to remove the riddle-like line. Google really does make sign-in open the browser, so the Google wait screen has to say plainly \"Finish signing in in your browser\".\n- **Filaments that came in without their base profile.** The line telling people what to use instead must match what the app actually does. If nobody checks that before the redraw, we leave the line out.\n- **What happens after the free month.** The welcome board on \"Credits & plans\" already answers part of it: \"After that, 50 free credits a month.\" It also says \"about 100 Expert questions\", which is the same problem as the one review fix not yet in the code. I proposed \"about 100 questions to the agent\" for both places.\n- **\"Use your own AI account.\"** My welcome board already shows two cards marked Free: \"Your own API key\" and \"Claude Code or Claude Desktop\". The other session's report shows one card. I asked which version you saw and liked, and we'll go with that.\n\n**Decision needed: what happens when the free month ends, or on the day the credits expire?** That session wants one line under the sign-up offer saying whether a card is needed and whether anything is charged. Only you know the answer. The line it proposes would state those two facts. If the answer is \"no card, nothing charged\", I'd write \"No card needed. After the first month you get 50 free credits a month.\" Is that right, or do you want different terms?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1781,"cache_read_input_tokens":188170,"output_tokens":640,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1781,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":640,"cache_read_input_tokens":188170,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1781,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1781},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgn9hzf1Fdkk6DGywsAgp","requestRef":"74a9d7dc-71a2-4815-9e26-02e57b89b588","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_session_mgmt","attributionMcpTool":"send_message","type":"assistant","uuid":"76d80f9a-54eb-4863-85ca-45a326caecc6","timestamp":"2026-11-06T18:30:55.630Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror/tools/composer","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
