title\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">First launch: three steps, then Home</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">The top row is the usual path. Under each step are the other ways through it. The numbers are the boards on this page.</div></div><div data-n=\"Welcome (01)\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;left:40px;top:120px;width:560px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-12)\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;\"><div class=\"label-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">STEP 1 · WELCOME</div><div class=\"section\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Welcome (01)</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:relative;width:560px;height:350px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:var(--elevation-medium)\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:1280px;height:800px;transform:scale(0.4375);transform-origin:0 0\"><dc-import theme=\"{{theme}}\" name=\"first-run-welcome-01-clip-beat-1\" hint-size=\"1280px,800px\"></dc-import></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle)\"></div></div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Pick how the agent thinks: sign in for 500 credits, your own API key, Claude Code or Claude Desktop, or Just slice for now.</div></div><div data-n=\"Signed in (05)\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;left:700px;top:120px;width:560px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-12)\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;\"><div class=\"label-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">STEP 1 · WELCOME</div><div class=\"section\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Signed in (05)</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:relative;width:560px;height:350px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:var(--elevation-medium)\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:1280px;height:800px;transform:scale(0.4375);transform-origin:0 0\"><dc-import theme=\"{{theme}}\" name=\"first-run-05-welcome-signed-in\" hint-size=\"1280px,800px\"></dc-import></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle)\"></div></div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">The card says who signed in. After a moment the app moves on by itself.</div></div><div data-n=\"Which printer do you have? (08)\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;left:1360px;top:120px;width:560px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-12)\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;\"><div class=\"label-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">STEP 2 · YOUR PRINTER</div><div class=\"section\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Which printer do you have? (08)</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:relative;width:560px;height:350px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:var(--elevation-medium)\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:1280px;height:800px;transform:scale(0.4375);transform-origin:0 0\"><dc-import theme=\"{{theme}}\" name=\"first-run-08-add-printer\" hint-size=\"1280px,800px\"></dc-import></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle)\"></div></div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Brand, model and nozzle, then Continue. Skip for now is the other way on.</div></div><div data-n=\"Home (09)\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;left:2020px;top:120px;width:560px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-12)\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;\"><div class=\"label-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">STEP 3 · HOME</div><div class=\"section\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Home (09)</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:relative;width:560px;height:350px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:var(--elevation-medium)\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:1280px;height:800px;transform:scale(0.4375);transform-origin:0 0\"><dc-import theme=\"{{theme}}\" name=\"first-run-09-home-after-sign-in\" hint-size=\"1280px,800px\"></dc-import></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle)\"></div></div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">The account and its credits, shown once, and the printer just picked. Onboarding is done.</div></div><div data-n=\"Other ways through the welcome\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;left:40px;top:620px;width:1260px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-8);padding:var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-subtle);border-radius:var(--radius-large);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle)\"><div class=\"body-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Other ways through the welcome</div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;padding:var(--space-12) var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-raised);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle);\"><div class=\"body-small-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Continue with Google</div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">The card waits while the browser signs in (04), then Signed in (05).</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;padding:var(--space-12) var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-raised);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle);\"><div class=\"body-small-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Continue with email</div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">A code or the password (12, 13), then the six-digit code (14 to 16), then Signed in (05).</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;padding:var(--space-12) var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-raised);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle);\"><div class=\"body-small-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Your own API key, or Claude Code or Claude Desktop</div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Preferences › Agent opens over the welcome (06). Saving a key, or Done, closes it and goes to Your printer. Closing it unfinished goes back to the welcome.</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;padding:var(--space-12) var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-raised);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle);\"><div class=\"body-small-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Just slice for now</div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Straight to Your printer. The agent can be set up later from Home.</div></div></div><div data-n=\"Other ways through Your printer\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;left:1360px;top:620px;width:560px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-8);padding:var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-subtle);border-radius:var(--radius-large);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle)\"><div class=\"body-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Other ways through Your printer</div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;padding:var(--space-12) var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-raised);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle);\"><div class=\"body-small-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">OrcaSlicer is on this computer</div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Bring your printers from OrcaSlicer? (07) shows instead, with the printers saved there and those ticked in its printer list. Import, then Imported (17), then Home. Start fresh shows 08.</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;padding:var(--space-12) var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-raised);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle);\"><div class=\"body-small-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">JusPrin v1 is on this computer</div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">This step is skipped. The welcome-back window shows over Home (1c, 1d).</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;padding:var(--space-12) var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-raised);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle);\"><div class=\"body-small-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Can’t find your printer? Ask the agent</div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Only when the agent is set up. Home opens with the printer chat, the same as + Add printer, and the agent adds it.</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;padding:var(--space-12) var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-raised);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle);\"><div class=\"body-small-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Skip for now</div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Home with No printer yet (10).</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;padding:var(--space-12) var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-raised);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle);\"><div class=\"body-small-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Back</div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">The welcome again. Anything finished there stays finished.</div></div></div><div data-n=\"Home\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;left:2020px;top:620px;width:560px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-8);padding:var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-subtle);border-radius:var(--radius-large);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle)\"><div class=\"body-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Home</div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);align-items:flex-start;padding:var(--space-12) var(--space-16);background:var(--surface-raised);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle);\"><div class=\"body-small-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">After signing in</div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;f