no Retry.\n- 09: the account card with a labelled \"Hide\". The printer card has Connect… and \"Connect it to send prints straight from JusPrin\".\n- 10: \"Set up the agent\", the why-line, the sign-in, and the Free card.\n- The map (11) and the page notes are updated too.\n\nThree places where I did something other than your list:\n1. Home's \"No printer yet\" card and the drop-zone line on 10 keep the app's present-tense wording: \"Until you add yours, files are sliced for a 250 mm Klipper printer and may not print on other printers.\" On Home the person has already skipped, so that sentence describes the actual state, and \"If you skip\" would be wrong there. The \"If you skip…\" wording is only on 08. Tell the code session the same: change STAND_IN_PRINTER only where the printer step uses it, not in Home's card.\n2. I didn't touch main-08. It's on the main page, and the onboarding builder uses it as the frame for Home's boards. 10 draws the state you described.\n3. The caption change also needs the welcome video re-rendered (resources/jusprin/welcome/welcome-clip.mp4). The pill is burned into the video, so a CSS change won't remove it.\n\nStill waiting on Kenneth: the line saying what happens after the first month. I asked him too; whichever of us hears first tells the other."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XXY6WUF7PUR3w7Qf8doP4c","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__wrap_up","input":{"recap":"The onboarding boards now match today's app plus the fixes agreed with the review session; published as canvas version 132 and that session told. Still open: your answer on what happens after the free month.","ask":"After the free month: no card needed, then 50 free credits a month?","actions":[{"label":"Yes, that's right"},{"label":"Different terms"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
