{"parentUuid":"0cc0a12f-a0eb-44ad-95cc-0bb6bb7a74a2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnALanLffdUAsZc6UBZ7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The \"On boarding experience\" boards now show what the app shows today (commit b0a2fe3b08), plus the wording fixes the review session and I agreed. They're published as version 132 of the canvas: https://claude.ai/artifact/ENCtdaz7gjynfbcy4JYbWJ. I told the review session it's published.\n\n**Where the review session and I disagreed, I took its version on all four points:**\n- The Google sign-in wait keeps the app's \"Finish in your browser.\"\n- The own-account option is one card: \"Use your own AI account\", with \"Your API key, or Claude Code or Claude Desktop\" under it and \"Free\" on the right.\n- A filament that couldn't be imported now ends with \"Pick a similar filament from the filament menu instead.\" That session checked in the code that this is what a person can actually do.\n- The offer says \"about 100 messages to the agent\", which matches how the composer counts credits.\n\n**What the boards show now:**\n- **Signing up:** \"Sign up free\" sends the email code straight away. Only \"Already have an account? Sign in\" offers the choice between a code and a password.\n- **The welcome:** the line \"Google opens your browser; email stays here.\" is gone, and \"Show it what happened.\" in the welcome picture is plain caption text, no longer a dark pill.\n- **Choosing a printer:** the line explaining what Skip does shows only while no printer is chosen. I added a new board for the moment just after a printer is chosen, while its settings load.\n- **The OrcaSlicer import result:** it names the filaments that came over.\n- **Home:** the signed-in card has a \"Hide\" button where the unlabelled ✕ was.\n- **The pricing welcome board** on \"Credits & plans\" uses the same offer wording.\n\n**Three things that don't match the review session's list:**\n- **Home's \"No printer yet\" card** keeps the app's wording, \"Until you add yours, files are sliced for a 250 mm Klipper printer…\". On Home the person has already skipped, so \"If you skip…\" would be wrong there. The new wording is only on the printer step.\n- **The welcome video** has to be re-rendered for the caption change, because the pill is part of the video itself.\n- **Main page's Home board** is unchanged. The onboarding page's Home boards use it as their background, so I left it alone.\n\nNot done: no line yet says what happens after the free month. That's the question in the box below."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1669,"cache_read_input_tokens":328962,"output_tokens":775,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1669,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":775,"cache_read_input_tokens":328962,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1669,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1669},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgnALaQXEC3bHQbHBXMEg","requestRef":"60d00dd3-9ba1-48d0-ab6c-1a35a4f28f7e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"fe315b8a-cb75-4da2-be9a-309bc90b6baf","timestamp":"2026-11-06T18:39:12.738Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438/scratchpad/published/project","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e