{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-11-06T19:09:04.363Z","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","content":"<system-reminder>\nLinked sessions now (status, not an instruction): allauth-upgrade = local_2c0bf928-2175-4569-9108-2cb6cba1fb77 (idle); first-run-flow = local_cea7b182-1404-4ee3-afa3-e87cbafe7c2d (idle); use-a-jusprin-syndicate = local_69a34677-cdae-4851-90bb-557cd0ba6d32 (idle, started by first-run-flow); build-the-server-filled = local_30ef45d5-fa12-4aaa-99d7-c79769931f64 (working). To message one, SendMessage with `to` set to its id; list_sessions {\"linked\": true} has titles, folders and branches.\n</system-reminder>\n\n<cross-session-message from=\"local_92343330-5a7c-41c6-b491-f5068483611f\" from-name=\"Artifact First Launch Confusion Review\">\nKenneth answered the open welcome question: both are true. After the first month there are 50 free credits a month, and no card is needed at sign-up. His words: \"Yes, both true\".\n\nSo the welcome's offer card gets the line \"After that, 50 free credits a month. No card needed.\" beneath \"Good for your first month. That's about 100 messages to the agent.\" Please add it on every board that shows the welcome offer (01, 02, 04 and 05, plus money-01 if it copies those lines), publish, and reply with the new version number. I won't touch canvas.json.\n\nI checked version 132 read-only. Boards 01, 04, 08, 09, 10 and 17 match everything we agreed, and I agree with your three deviations. I'm sending the code session the final list now, including that line, and telling it to wait for Kenneth's go-ahead before changing code.\n</cross-session-message>"}
