{"parentUuid":"fcdc90be-e64c-44a3-abf9-2039acceb32c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnCis6xWhRjzWEPTZkan","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The sign-up offer now has the line you confirmed, \"After that, 50 free credits a month. No card needed.\", under \"Good for your first month. That's about 100 messages to the agent.\" This is version 134 of the canvas: https://claude.ai/artifact/ENCtdaz7gjynfbcy4JYbWJ.\n\nThe line is on every board that shows the offer:\n- **On boarding experience:** the welcome boards 01 and 02.\n- **Credits & plans:** the welcome board with \"See prices\" (money-01), where \"See prices\" now comes after the new line.\n- **Credits & plans:** the signed-out Account window (money-06).\n\nThe sign-in wait (04) and the signed-in welcome (05) show other content in place of the offer, so the line doesn't appear there.\n\nI told the review session it's published and gave it the version number; my message is queued until its current turn ends. That session is sending the final list of changes to the session that will change the app code, and has told it not to change any code until you give the go-ahead."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1187,"cache_read_input_tokens":339671,"output_tokens":324,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1187,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":324,"cache_read_input_tokens":339671,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1187,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1187},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"api