{"parentUuid":"961cf456-7be5-4e41-a3ae-49b232c0d750","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"34a89a4a-5751-40b1-8fdb-7570b7e35680","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018deFgB5cxK8RhfCJKxgntJ","type":"tool_result","content":"f46e5ac05f 2026-11-05\nCredits. The app shows and spends JusPrin Cloud credits; every credit is the\nsame, and a balance is one number of credits.\n- Model pickers show each model's price, and are greyed once the chat has a\n  message. The balance shows as a ring with a hover panel: one bar per lot,\n  grouped by expiry, bought credits included. A message that can't be paid\n  for offers \"Get more credits\"; a 402 from the gateway ends in a failed card.\n  \"About 25 credits left\" shows once at 25 credits or less.\n- A new account chat starts on Expert while a first-month lot is live, and on\n  Standard after it. A Standard chat leaves out the picture tools; a picture\n  there shows as a warning on its chip, with Remove.\n- Turns the app starts itself send X-JusPrin-Request: note and run on Expert\n  without changing the chat's model. RecordConversion turns one provider\n  format's stored turn into the other's, byte for byte, so caches still hit.\n- A turn that polls for its own slice is answered with busy, and the third\nclaude/first-run-flow-f7be35: 1 of 1 changed files identical in f46e5ac05f\nclaude/elated-sutherland-84a741: 1 of 1 changed files identical in f46e5ac05f\n+ claude/elated-sutherland-84a741\n  claude/first-run-flow-f7be35\n+ credits-integration-2026-11\nfirst-run-flow is inside elated-sutherland","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8c036423-f7ec-4c66-bec2-f4c283234ca0","timestamp":"2026-11-06T19:41:24.641Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"f46e5ac05f 2026-11-05\nCredits. The app shows and spends JusPrin Cloud credits; every credit is the\nsame, and a balance is one number of credits.\n- Model pickers show each model's price, and are greyed once the chat has a\n  message. The balance shows as a ring with a hover p