5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3a15942a-080a-4902-95bc-82e9cc1d4717","timestamp":"2026-11-06T19:41:40.684Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
{"parentUuid":"3a15942a-080a-4902-95bc-82e9cc1d4717","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"34a89a4a-5751-40b1-8fdb-7570b7e35680","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BX6obonofUZqXjNXuahMP5","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nname: announce-hold-forgot-closed-project-call\ndescription: \"ToolExecutionCoordinator: forget_if_closed must wait for pump()'s held announcement; fixed d354a20687 (2026-11-05)\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: cf7649d3-46dd-4047-a831-32851ae18292\n  modified: 2026-11-05T20:01:11.044Z\n---\n\nSince 3aa5a4435d (2026-11-03) pump() holds a call's terminal notify back (m_announce_after) until its dialogs are answered. project_open and calibration_generate (from outside a calibration project) call forget_if_closed() inside execute(), which erased the record before pump() announced it, so the card and the model's result stayed Running. Fixed in d354a20687 on jusprin-newui: forget_if_closed() defers via m_forget_after_announce, pump() forgets after notify.\n\n**Why:** three agent_bridge_tests cases (\"opening a project names the activity…\", two calibration ones) failed for two days and every session called them \"older failures\".\n\n**How to apply:** any new hold on notify() in the coordinator must check every path that erases a record during execute(). Also on 2026-11-05: the sign-in/credits/first-run branch (claude/elated-sutherland-84a741) was squashed into one commit f46e5ac05f on jusprin-newui, with the coordinator fix kept separate so a sign-in revert keeps it; see [[jusprin-full-syndicate-decision]].\n20:branch claude/credits-ledger. The welcome-back window's kept-price box stays\n81:Squashed from claude/elated-sutherland-84a741 (19 commits, 48ec76705d to\n82:4b16e4b1eb), merged onto the printer card change.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"a14d3591-677c-459b-84d4-3b2527920512","timestamp":"2026-11-06T19:41:40.864Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"---\nname: announce-hold-forgot-closed-project-call\ndescription: \"ToolExecutionCoordinator: forget_if_closed must wait for pump()'s held announcement; fixed d354a20687 (2026-11-05)\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: cf7649d3-46dd-4047-a831-32851ae18292\n  modified: 2026-11-05T20:01:11.044Z\n---\n\nSince 3aa5a4435d (2026-11-03) pump() holds a call's terminal notify back (m_announce_after) until its dialogs are answered. project_open and calibration_generate (from outside a calibration project) call forget_if_closed() inside execute(), which erased the record before pump() announced it, so the card and the model's result stayed Running. Fixed in d354a20687 on jusprin-newui: forget_if_closed() defers via m_forget_after_announce, pump() forgets after notify.\n\n**Why:** three agent_bridge_tests cases (\"opening a project names the activity…\", two calibration ones) failed for two days and every session called them \"older failures\".\n\n**How to apply:** any new hold on notify() in the coordinator must check every path that erases a record during execute(). Also on 2026-11-05: the sign-in/credits/first-run branch (claude/elated-sutherland-84a741) was squashed into one commit f46e5ac05f on jusprin-newui, with the coordinator fix kept separate so a sign-in revert keeps it; see [[jusprin-full-syndicate-decision]].\n20:branch claude/credits-ledger. The welcome-back window's kept-price box stays\n81:Squashed from claude/elated-sutherland-84a741 (19 commits, 48ec76705d to\n82:4b16e4b1eb), merged onto the printer card change.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3a15942a-080a-4902-95bc-82e9cc1d4717","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
