{"parentUuid":"19aae4de-993a-47b3-9135-0c798cda4630","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"34a89a4a-5751-40b1-8fdb-7570b7e35680","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013j86dmoe2e1faCLvWwKG7k","type":"tool_result","content":"2ebce6c1a7 Add GET /ent/jusprin/v2/account_box: the launch offer for the app's Account page\ne45accfd9c Keep plate_presence out of the default ML API services\n811a5a98f0 Add an Elegoo API that detects a missing build plate from one photo\n41824c2f69 Add dompurify 3.4.17 to the web_ent frontend lockfile\n1845fe74b9 Give JusPrin 2 a syndicate and brand of its own, the jusprinv2 syndicate\ncf01e7adbf Revert \"Start accounts made by signing in to JusPrin 2 on Obico's free plan\"\n5daee67e1b Start accounts made by signing in to JusPrin 2 on Obico's free plan\n17e87ee16e Serve JusPrin's email sign-in from allauth's API for apps\nbd43dfc7dc Merge branch 'claude/email-sign-in'\nd799b57e37 Drop the test for two accounts sharing an address in one syndicate\naa70569e4f Build JusPrin's email sign-in on allauth and django-oauth-toolkit\n81efc6fd43 Let the JusPrin app sign in by email, with a code or a password\n7ca77f7409 Pass JUSPRIN_OPENROUTER_API_KEY into the local web container\na1341547b9 Apply the final JusPrin credit rules to the ledger\n7c69f331be Keep JusPrin v2 chats as raw text, without branch files\n\n1845fe74b9 Give JusPrin 2 a syndicate and brand of its own, the jusprinv2 syndicate\n17e87ee16e Serve JusPrin's email sign-in from allauth's API for apps\nd799b57e37 Drop the test for two accounts sharing an address in one syndicate\naa70569e4f Build JusPrin's email sign-in on allauth and django-oauth-toolkit\n81efc6fd43 Let the JusPrin app sign in by email, with a code or a password\n016f1462cc Remove JusPrin integration and related components from the codebase, including API refere\ne7e5ece02b yumi syndicate\n50a964ae9a Move JusPrin syndicate determination to the backend so that it works for the non-vue page\n\n2ebce6c1a7 2026-11-06 HEAD -> master, claude/account-box\n0\t1","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e9747893-31ce-4631-be4d-b1db21da58b7","timestamp":"2026-11-06T19:41:59.514Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"2ebce6c1a7 Add GET /ent/jusprin/v2/account_box: the launch offer for the app's Account page\ne45accfd9c Keep plate_presence out of the default ML API services\n811a5a98f0 Add an Elegoo API that detects a missing build plate from one photo\n41824c2f69 Add dompurify 3.4.17 to the web_ent frontend lockfile\n1845fe74b9 Give JusPrin 2 a syndicate and brand of its own, the jusprinv2 syndicate\ncf01e7adbf Revert \"Start accounts made by signing in to JusPrin 2 on Obico's free plan\"\n5daee67e1b Start accounts made by signing in to JusPrin 2 on Obico's free plan\n17e87ee16e Serve JusPrin's email sign-in from allauth's API for apps\nbd43dfc7dc Merge branch 'claude/email-sign-in'\nd799b57e37 Drop the test for two accounts sharing an address in one syndicate\naa70569e4f Build JusPrin's email sign-in on allauth and django-oauth-toolkit\n81efc6fd43 Let the JusPrin app sign in by email, with a code or a password\n7ca77f7409 Pass JUSPRIN_OPENROUTER_API_KEY into the local web container\na1341547b9 Apply the final JusPrin credit rules to the ledger\n7c69f331be Keep JusPrin v2 chats as raw text, without branch files\n\n1845fe74b9 Give JusPrin 2 a syndicate and brand of its own, the jusprinv2 syndicate\n17e87ee16e Serve JusPrin's email sign-in from allauth's API for apps\nd799b57e37 Drop the test for two accounts sharing an address in one syndicate\naa70569e4f Build JusPrin's email sign-in on allauth and django-oauth-toolkit\n81efc6fd43 Let the JusPrin app sign in by email, with a code or a password\n016f1462cc Remove JusPrin integration and related components from the codebase, including API refere\ne7e5ece02b yumi syndicate\n50a964ae9a Move JusPrin syndicate determination to the backend so that it works for the non-vue page\n\n2ebce6c1a7 2026-11-06 HEAD -> master, claude/account-box\n0\t1","stderr