{"parentUuid":"2b027ebd-733c-4226-8e8a-808628d2db19","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnFAKpEEFbYAECYsiJmb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"None of the linked sessions has unmerged commits. Every branch they worked on is already on its repo's main branch: `jusprin-newui` for the app, `master` for the server. Three commits are committed locally on those main branches but not pushed.\n\n**Branches, by session:**\n- [Build the first-run flow on top of the credits branch](#local_cea7b182-1404-4ee3-afa3-e87cbafe7c2d) and [Use a JusPrin syndicate sharing accounts with Obico](#local_69a34677-cdae-4851-90bb-557cd0ba6d32): the app branches `claude/first-run-flow-f7be35`, `claude/elated-sutherland-84a741` and `credits-integration-2026-11` show 16 to 19 commits that aren't on `jusprin-newui`. That count is misleading. On 5 November the whole of `claude/elated-sutherland-84a741` (19 commits, which contain the other two branches) was squashed into one commit, f46e5ac05f, on `jusprin-newui`; that commit's message records it.\n- [Upgrade django-allauth from 0.63.6 to 65.x in tsd-enterprise](#local_2c0bf928-2175-4569-9108-2cb6cba1fb77): `claude/email-sign-in` is fully on the server's `master`.\n- The syndicate session's server branch, `claude/jusprin-syndicate`: its 5 commits were squashed into 1845fe74b9 on `master`. Five of its six files match `master` exactly. The sixth, `settings_ent.py`, differs only because `master` has since gained the launch-offer end date.\n- [Build the server-filled box on Preferences › Account](#local_30ef45d5-fa12-4aaa-99d7-c79769931f64): its work is committed straight onto both main branches, as listed below.\n\n**Committed but not pushed:**\n\n| Repo | Commit | What |\n|---|---|---|\n| JusPrin, `jusprin-newui` | 3e5034e194 | Preferences › Account: the box the server fills |\n| JusPrin, `jusprin-newui` | 8acb12318c | Design guidelines doc |\n| tsd-enterprise, `master` | 2ebce6c1a7 | `GET /ent/jusprin/v2/account_box` |\n\n**One leftover:** the server worktree `tsd-enterprise-worktrees/jusprinv2-release` has a \"Check in built bundles\" commit, 5046b75817, that sits on no branch. It's an older release build: the `release` branch has a newer build, 55a5c4872a, from today, and that branch is pushed. Nothing is lost if that worktree is removed.\n\nThe first-run-flow worktree also has an untracked `.playwright-mcp/` folder, which is test-tool output."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":448,"cache_read_input_tokens":357898,"output_tokens":928,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":448,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":928,"cache_read_input_tokens":357898,"cache_creation_input_tokens":448,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":448},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgnFAKPgdMLLB9ANUw1BN","requestRef":"1f3b79ee-a1a3-452f-813e-e46d489f707c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"a76302da-eedc-4985-bf09-6e741c56f5d5","timestamp":"2026-11-06T19:42:27.525Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
